# OpenLia Workspace Calendar
# Powered by Remind (https://manpages.debian.org/testing/remind/remind.1.en.html)
#
# Syntax:
#   REM <date_spec> [*N] [FROM <date>] [UNTIL <date> | THROUGH <date>] [AT <time>] \
#       [DURATION <duration>] [TAG <tags>] [INFO "<Header>: <Value>"]... MSG <Summary>
#   Common date specs include weekdays, multiple weekdays, monthly day numbers,
#   annual month/day pairs, and bounded date ranges. Native Remind remains the
#   source of truth; the workspace preview reports unsupported advanced clauses.
#
# Supported INFO Headers:
#   INFO "Attendees: Name <email>, [[Person]]"
#   INFO "Location: Physical address, office room, or venue"
#   INFO "Map-Url: https://maps.google.com/?q=..."
#   INFO "Video-Link: https://meet.google.com/... or https://zoom.us/..."
#   INFO "Description: Meeting details and agenda"
#   INFO "Event-Note: calendar/YYYY-MM-DD-event-note.md"
